window.products.push({"id":286300,"name":"Meat Grinder Electric, Heavy Duty Meat Mincer, 500W Max 2000W Stainless Steel Food Grinder Multifunctional Sausage Stuffer Maker with 3 Plates, Sausag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HXUGS4itL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【FCC APPROVED and POWERFUL 2000W MOTOR】Electric meat grinder enhances high efficiency, keeps original taste of meat and produces 4.4 lbs minced meat per minute, more convenient and efficient than chop food by hand.With a dedicated manual or automatic meat grinder, you can grind your own blends from whatever cuts of meat you choose, giving you complete control over the ingredients, amount of fat (aka flavor, juiciness, and nutrition), and quality of your ground meat. 【3-STAGE SPIRAL ROD TECHNOLOGY】The meat grinder electric is easy to use with pressing the buttons. While starting, the auger grinds the meat in 3 steps spiral extrusion without destroying the meat fiber. It ensure the chewy and firmness sense of the ground meat. Meet all your cooking needs of preparing the seasoning meat sauce, hamburgers, sausages, salad, juice, baby food, pet food. 【MULTIFUNCTIONAL FOOD GRINDER ATTACHMENTS】Electric meat grinder equipped with three different stainless steel cutting plates (fine, medium, and coarse), a sausage kit, and an attachment to make kubbe, 1 removable food tray and 1 food pusher. The hollow sausages filled with stuffings popular in Mediterranean cuisine. 【SAFETY PROTECTION, USE AT EASE】The meat grinder with three buttons (on/off/reverse) is easy to operate; the reverse button is used to dredge the equipment, the electric meat grinder anti-overload and anti-overheat protection system (if it runs abnormally, the machine Will be automatically protected). 【EASY TO CLEAN】Clean all parts thoroughly in warm water with soap(under 122°F). Always dry the parts immediately after washing for a longer service life. Please notice that all parts can not be washed by dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HXUGS4itL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WekiiStar","source_asin":"B09XXCL8F1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-286300","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XXCL8F1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XXCL8F1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
