window.products.push({"id":286409,"name":"HomeBee, Silicone Steam Release Accessory Compatible with Instant Pot and Pressure Cooker Mini 3/6/8 Qt, Duo/Duo Plus/Smart/Ultra Models | Cabinet Sav","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VLTXytAoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"COMPATIBILITY: Our rubbery steam diverter fits Instant Pot pressure cooker Mini, 3 Qt, 5 Qt, 6 Qt or 8 Quart, most DUO series(Duo60, Duo80), Ultra and Smart models. It will also work with any other electric power cookers brands with a valve less than 1.1” like Cosori, Mealthy, Mueller Ultra 10-in-1, Costco version ‘Nova” and the QVC version \"Viva\". [ DOES NOT FIT LUX MODEL ] FOOD GRADE SAFE MATERIAL: HomeBee steam diverter is made from food grade silicon. It is BPA-FREE and heat resistant. Our product stays straight with a snug fit on to the venting knob without wobbling or leaning to sides. Don’t worry about leaking ever again with our leak proof design. SAFEGUARD FROM MOISTURE AND WARPING: With 360° rotatable design, you can adjust the steam pipe to exhaust in any direction. It will protect your walls, cupboards, cabinets, counters or other obstacles from condensation and mold. No more mess and water damage after venting. Designed to be light enough to prevent locking pressure on the valve to make sure not to violate your pressure cooker’s warranty while providing the necessary seal for the steam flux. EASY TO USE & CLEAN: Attach the diverter part over the vent knob on your pressure cooker and when it is time to switch from sealed to vent, just adjust the diverter part to the 'venting' not the 'sealing' position (BE CAREFUL: DO NOT stand directly in front of the steam!). After you are done with cooking, hand wash the diverter with soapy water or simply put in the dishwasher. SATISFACTION GUARANTEED with HASSLE-FREE HOMEBEE WARRANTY: HomeBee warranty covers your experience from the moment you order. Our warranty covers any possible issue including shipping damages with a swift online inspection process. If in any way you are not satisfied with your purchase, just give our team a chance to make it right via message and your satisfaction is guaranteed either with a replacement or refund!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VLTXytAoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomeBee","source_asin":"B07P9FC1VH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-286409","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P9FC1VH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P9FC1VH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
