window.products.push({"id":286433,"name":"PROMOZE Manual Can Opener with Easy Grip - (Black) - Heavy Duty Stainless Steel – Built-in Can/Bottle Opener - Easy Turn Knob for People with Weak Han","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411ymxRwk5L._AC_.jpg","description":"Easy Grip, No Slip Kitchen Can Opener!🙃 No More Kitchen Frustration! If you are frustrated by can openers that break after one time of use or leave red marks on your hand every time you try and open a can of food,then Promoze brings you our new fast, sharp and easy grip can opener.Or have you ever tried to open a ring pull can and pulled the ring off leaving the can closed?We have, so that's why we designed this opener.So, you can always have a durable and easy to use can opener handy in the kitchen to open your cans of food and not rely on the flimsy ring pull cans.⭐ Features and Specifications: ✔ Easy Grip Handles - the anti-slip silicon coating allows you to grip in comfort with no slipping or sliding.✔ Snap Lock Design – The gears and blade snap into place on the edge of the can making sure it stays securely in place.✔ Oversized Turning Handle – Makes opening cans easy for children, elderly or people with weak hands.✔ Stainless Steel Design – No rust, or corrosion and will stay sharp for years to come.✔ Hanging Loops – Allows you to hang the can opener conveniently anywhere you want in your kitchen.✔ Built-in Bottle Opener - Open beer or bottles of soda easily with the built-in lift opener.✔ Easy to Clean – Simply wash with a little soap and warm water and walla.⏩ Efficient and Smooth Design! Enjoy the smooth operation of the stainless-steel cutting blades that lock into place and allow you to effortlessly open almost any type of can.From pet food to soda cans you can rely on this strong and sharp manual opener. 100% Satisfaction Guaranteed: At Promoze, we strive and focus on our customer satisfaction. Therefore, we only manufacture products that are built to last. On top of that, we offer a top notch satisfaction guarantee, so if any issues arise, feel free to contact us, and we will help you to the max.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411ymxRwk5L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PROMOZE","source_asin":"B0776NNWD7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-286433","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0776NNWD7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0776NNWD7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
