window.products.push({"id":286457,"name":"Holy Family Glass Christmas Ornament 5 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.52,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OJ4yhBleL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"5 Inches Tall X 3 Inches Wide 12.7 cm Tall x 7.6 Wide cm Glass Hand Painted Mouth Blown Glittered Accents Gift Boxed Religious ornaments are a popular way to celebrate Christmas. They come in a variety of styles, from glass balls to hand-painted nativity scenes. Many people enjoy collecting religious ornaments, and many families have a tradition of passing down their favorite ornaments from one generation to the next. Religious ornaments are a great way to add a personal touch to your Christmas decor, and they can also be a thoughtful gift for someone who is celebrating their first Christmas. Whether you are looking for an ornament for your own collection or you are shopping for a gift, there is a wide variety of religious ornaments available to choose from. Decorate your holiday tree with BestPysanky unique mouth blown hand crafted Christmas ornament! It is meticulously crafted by hand using traditional techniques that originated in the 1800's. The Renaissance-era carving, molding, glass blowing, silver lining, painting and finishing processes require unparalleled skill and several weeks to complete. The molten glass is mouth-blown into finely carved molds to shape the ornament. It is then painted and glittered in a series of labor-intensive steps to achieve the beautiful final products. Exquisite workmanship and details are the hallmark of all BestPysanky ornaments. We aim to bring warmth, color, spirit and sparkle into your home with our unique decor, as you admire and celebrate the holidays with your loved ones. It's more than just an ornament- it's a work of art!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OJ4yhBleL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BestPysanky","source_asin":"B015MA4OE0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-286457","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015MA4OE0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015MA4OE0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":286458,"name":"Silicone Cooking Utensils Set,Heat Resistant,With Stainless Steel Core,Non Stick and Comfortable Grip,25 Pcs Reusable Food Storage Bags,bpa Free","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VxH1ejObL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"✮ We Don't Invent,But We Keep Upgrading!-We are a professional kitchenware producer who have been focus on customer experience. In order to offer better and eco-friendly kitchenware.Wookon collects customer reviews of all similar products on Amazon. And then upgrade the products based on the data of the bad evaluation with the aim to provide customers with more perfect kitchenware products. ✮ High Heat Resistant Silicone Without Melting & Odor-You may have bought inferior silicone which will melt in a hot pot, has a strong smell, easy crack and absorb odor, as 17.59% reviews reflect. Wookon upgraded the material to BPA FREE silicone - the same material as baby nipple, which is more durable and heat resistant (up to 600°F). No more degradation/cracking in high heat situations and do not absorb odor! ✮ Perfect Balance Of Flexibility & Stiffness-You may be sick of silicone either too stiff or too soft as 21.95% reviews have suffered. Thus, we have enhanced the thickness while maintaining a good balance between its stiffness and flex. You shall find that the wookon silicone spatula are stiff enough to bear strong pressure and soft enough to reach every side of the bowl. Non stick design is safe for your pans or pots. ✮ Handles Are Thickened To Avold Bending-You may feel embarrassed that the handles of the measure set bend while baking as 7.25% reviews have encountered. In order to avoid your countertop in a terrible mess with all the ingredients spilling out, we thickened the metal handles to avoid bending. ✮ Easy To Use & clean-It brings everything you need for cooking, including Slotted Turner, Slotted Spoon, Soup Ladle, Pasta Server,Big Spatula, Small Spatula, Spoonula, Tongs, Whisk and Brush, and holder. all of your utensils will be washed cleanly. Ideal gift for housewarming, weddings, Mother’s Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas and more. ✮ 25 Pcs High Sealed Organizer Bags can be stored in the fridge, pantry or cabinets. It can store all kinds of food such as fresh meat,fruits and vegetsbles,cooked food,snacks,or other daily items,and can be take away.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VxH1ejObL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"wookon","source_asin":"B09J8ZKF15","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-286458","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J8ZKF15","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J8ZKF15","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
