window.products.push({"id":286806,"name":"La Miones, 100% Turkish Cotton Soft and Absorbent Towel Set for Bathrooms, Set of 6 Hotel Quality, Quick Dry Bath Towel Set, 2 Bath, 2 Hand Towels, 2 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rg+5tV-YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Genuine Turkish Cotton ✅ 100% GENUINE TURKISH COTTON - We use the finest quality cotton grown in the Aegean Region of Turkey to make our towels. ✅ Discover our 52 years of experience-based manufacturing technique and the soft, absorbent, quick-drying, and durable La Miones towels through our product descriptions. ✅ Thanks to its simple and sparkling design, it is highly suitable for use in luxury hotels, saunas, guest rooms, poolside areas, bathrooms, beaches, hair salons, dorm rooms, spas, wedding ceremonies, and gym areas. ✅ SIZE AND GIFTING - This set includes 2 wascloths with dimensions of 13x13 inches, 2 bath towels with dimensions of 57x24 inches, and 2 hand towels with dimensions of 16x28 inches. These towels are the perfect gift for housewarming, weddings, birthdays, anniversaries, Christmas, Thanksgiving and more. ♻️These Towels are STANDART 100 by OEKO-TEX Certified. You may see some lint in the first few washes, but this will decrease with continued washing. This doesn't affect the texture, or performance of your towels. To enhance absorbency, it is recommended to wash the towels in cold water before the first use. It is best to either tumble dry the towels on low heat or hang them to dry. Using fabric softener, dryer sheets, or bleach is not recommended as these can reduce the softness","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rg+5tV-YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"La Miones","source_asin":"B0BF55WFXQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-286806","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF55WFXQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF55WFXQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":286807,"name":"NOVICA Hand Beaded Christmas Holiday Ornaments, Dazzling Golden Stars' (Set of 5), Handmade in India","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QxGwk2n7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer.  About this item: Stars come to life with dazzling golden zardozi embroidery forming sunbursts in the center. Working in traditional Indian techniques, Parvez A. Warsi crafts ornaments with Rajasthani flair. The set of five brings luxury to holiday decor.  Warsi includes a drawstring pouch; its colors may vary.  - Dry clean only   About our Artist: Hello, my name is Parvez A Warsi and I was born on August 9, 1954 in the colorful city of Agra, where beauty begins and ends with one of the seven wonders of the world - the Taj Mahal. I have a longstanding relationship with the world of handicrafts. It all started when my ancestors began stitching royal clothing for kings, queens, princes and princesses. As time passed by I got myself into tailoring, though not stitching clothes for the royals but for the general public. Then, I joined my brother-in-law who was into crafting decorative items with embroidered motifs. I began to work with him in 1974 and helped him for almost eight years. In 1982, I started my own workshop of crafting gift items, wall hangings, evening bags, etc., all featuring embroidery work. During this time I was still involved in designing and stitching dresses with embroidered motifs.  I was personally involved in making the products until recently, for now I am able to offer jobs to other artisans and together we create new ides and designs. It's been a very long journey for me in the field of handicrafts. Every day is a new experience for me and with each experience I learn more about my work and my profession. I have very big dreams as far as my work is concerned.  I have displayed my products in many exhibitions with…","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QxGwk2n7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B0057Y2BP6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-286807","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0057Y2BP6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0057Y2BP6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
